STATE

  Version 0.0.6 on branch dev (Phase P1 foundation complete, ready for
  Fred's trial). Implemented and verified:
  - Integer HiDPI fallback via wl_compositor v6
    wl_surface.preferred_buffer_scale and wl_surface.set_buffer_scale
    when fractional-scale-v1/viewporter is absent.
  - Bold, italic, and bold-italic sibling faces auto-discovered from
    the main font path (or overridden in config), plus TrueType (glyf)
    fallback font chain for missing glyphs.
  - Procedural Box Drawing (U+2500..U+257F), Block Elements
    (U+2580..U+259F), and Braille Patterns (U+2800..U+28FF) in
    src/font/box.c so lines and blocks join pixel-for-pixel.
  - Configuration via libtam's tam_ini (~/.config/tam-last/tam-last.ini
    or -c/--config) for font, sibling/fallback faces, size, pad,
    include=, and [colors]/[colors-dark], defaulting to Tamlinux's dark
    theme.

